  "content": "# 音乐通知\n\n当游戏内播放音乐时，会弹出包含曲目名称、作者和专辑名称的提示通知。\n\n### **前置需求**：[Cloth Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)\n\n如果遇到任何问题，欢迎在 [GitHub](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/issues) 上提交 Issue。\n\n# 📷 游戏内截图\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">\"显示专辑名称\": 开启</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">不同的提示样式配置</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">兼容模组内容（<a href=\"\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-music-discs>更多音乐唱片</a>）</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n       <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">通过点唱机菜单随时随地播放任何音乐</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# 🎀 通知样式\n\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">普通提示</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">动作栏</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">紧凑模式</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# ⚙ 设置\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\">\n\n# 视频预览\nhttps://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA\n\n# 自定义\n如需支持自定义音乐或修改现有曲目，你需要在自定义资源包中，于命名空间 `musicnotification` 下添加一个名为 `musics.json` 的文件。\n\nJSON 架构可在此处查看：[DOCS.md](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md)\n如有任何疑问，欢迎提交 Issue。\n\n# 贡献者\n唱片图标由 [carotteatomique](https://github.com/carotteatomique) 制作  \n模组图标由 [akairoo](https://dribbble.com/akairoo) 制作  \n简体中文翻译由 [Chiloven945](https://github.com/Chiloven945) 完成",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
